Subject: [PATCH] Kindling: Pick the biome zoom cell exactly like vanilla and
 add an optional shortcut for uniform cells


diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/WorldGenRegion.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/WorldGenRegion.java
